From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 11:29:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 26/44] minimize: watch the firefox session file instead of
 polling it

Firefox tab counts now follow recovery.jsonlz4 through the inotify
watcher used for the terminal and Files tab files. It watches the
sessionstore-backups directory of each profile, and the profile bases
and new profiles for session directories that appear later. The 2 s
poll remains only when inotify fails or no profile has a session
directory yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

